#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1073-A expect=violation domain=TR
#note "TRLOC is present in TR although the IG prohibits it (TR does not include anatomical location information). Since the D-15 rewrite (2026-09-12) the Check is varname() in [TRLOC, TRLAT, TRDIR, TRPORTOT], routed as Variable Metadata Check / Record and evaluated per variable -> exactly ONE finding for the one prohibited column, pinned by variable_name (no row= pin: Violation.row carries the colIndex)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt variable_name=TRLOC
dataset TR label="Tumor Results"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col TRSEQ    type=Num
col TRTESTCD type=Char
col TRLOC    type=Char
---
S1 | TR | 001 | 1 | LDIAM | LIVER
---
